{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Troubles at Home", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Friends to the Rescue", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 1, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe ways of solving problems and getting things done in work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Causative with Have and Get", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the causative with <span class=\"strong\">have</span> and <span class=\"strong\">get</span> to show that you want someone to do something for you.  You cause the person to do something.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\">Causative Form with Have</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Subject + <span class=\"italic\">have</span> + agent + base form of the verb + object", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I had them install my washer.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/><span class=\"underline\">Causative Form with Get</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Subject + <span class=\"italic\">get</span> + agent + infinitive + object", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I'll get you guys to help me paint the house from top to bottom.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/>Notice that <span class=\"strong\">have</span> and <span class=\"strong\">get</span> can be used in any verb tense or form.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " Did you <span class=\"strong\">have someone install</span> your new washer?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I<span class=\"strong\">'ll have to have a carpenter put up</span> new drywall. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I<span class=\"strong\">'ll get you guys to help me paint</span> the house from top to bottom.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " I<span class=\"strong\">'ve decided to</span> kill two birds with one stone and also <span class=\"strong\">have someone renovate</span> the kitchen.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Could I get you to help me</span> with a budget?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Need + Passive Infinitive and Need +  Verb + ing", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Need + passive infinitive</span> and <span class=\"strong\">need + verb + ing</span> are two structures you use to talk about fixing problems. You use these structures to imply that we don't know who will fix the problem, or that the person fixing the problem is not the focus of the sentence.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The focus of the sentence below is the <span class=\"strong\">thing</span> that needs to be done.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">The faucets</span> are old and need to be replaced. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "This sentence is a passive sentence because we don't know who will do the action of replacing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The faucets are old and <span class=\"strong\">need to be replaced</span>. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You<span class=\"strong\">'ll need to get</span> someone to replace the insulation.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The whole kitchen <span class=\"strong\">needs to be redesigned</span> so I can cook with ease.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "There are a million other little things that <span class=\"strong\">need to be done</span> as well.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to fall apart", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to break owing to long use or poor construction", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: When one thing falls apart, so does another.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you make changes to your home.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "outdated", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not modern", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They noticed that my house is insulated with a very outdated and toxic insulation.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "fire hazard", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a material, substance, or action that increases the likelihood of an accidental fire occurring", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's a health and fire hazard.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "allergies", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a reaction of the body typically marked by skin rash", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It'll be dusty and if you stay, your allergies will act up.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to act up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "when someone or something does not perform as it should", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It'll be dusty and if you stay, your allergies will act up.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "drywall", "type": "name"}, {"content": "material of heavy paper used to make ceilings and walls", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll have to have a carpenter put up new drywall.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "faucet", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a device for controlling the flow of liquid from a pipe", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The faucets are old and need to be replaced.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "kill two birds with one stone", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to achieve two aims at once", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've decided to kill two birds with one stone.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to renovate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to restore to good condition", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've decided to kill two birds with one stone and also have someone renovate the kitchen.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob05aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "dusty", "type": "name"}, {"content": "filled or covered with or as if with dust", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It'll be dusty and if you stay, your allergies will act up.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob05aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Identify three household problems (broken pipe, leak, etc.).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find the names of the people whose job it is to fix the problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write three causative sentences about the problem.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find at least two other problems each person fixes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss with a friend which job is the best or worst.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about household problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I identify the people who fix the problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I identify other household problems that each person fixes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss which job is the best and worst.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn9le01ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn9le01ob05re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn9le01ob05re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: So did you have someone install your new washer?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, and when one thing falls apart, so does another. When I had them install  my washer they noticed that my house is insulated with a very outdated and toxic insulation. Needless to say, it's a health and fire hazard.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: So you'll need the insulation replaced.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Then, I'll have to have a carpenter put up new drywall. Then I'll get you guys to help me paint the house from top to bottom."}, {"image": "engenn9le01ob05re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "28000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're welcome to stay with me when all that work is getting done. It'll be dusty if you stay. Your allergies will act up.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Thanks. I might take you up on that offer. I've decided to kill two birds with one stone and also have someone renovate the kitchen.\nThe faucets are old and need to be replaced. Basically the whole kitchen needs to be redesigned so I can cook with ease. There are a million other little things that need to be done as well.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That will cost a small fortune.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: If you don't mind Peter, could I get you to help me and my landlord with a budget?"}, {"image": "engenn9le01ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "64000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's my area of expertise!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: This is so awesome! I have a friend who is an interior designer. We could get her to help us design your new kitchen.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well that's a nice offer, but I am pretty set with my own ideas.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Really? You could have fooled me!"}], "coverimg": "engenn9le01ob05re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about household problems and money.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about solving problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about things that need to be done. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Would you prefer to spend money on renovations or something else? Explain.", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " When do you get someone to help you with household problems?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Help! My house is falling apart!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": []}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1